WEBVTT

00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:03.920
Demon, demon, deruderubi!

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.580
Demon, demon, deruderubi!

00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:09.580
What're you doing, Aroma?

00:00:10.270 --> 00:00:15.240
I have attained instruments of prophecy from the revelatory grimoire Aroma.

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:17.550
They are called Aromat cards.

00:00:18.010 --> 00:00:19.740
You drew them, Aroma?

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:20.600
Devi!

00:00:21.310 --> 00:00:23.610
These 22 sable talismans

00:00:23.610 --> 00:00:29.480
shall lead our divine and infernal selves towards dominion over the realm of PriPara.

00:00:29.480 --> 00:00:30.530
That's so amazing!

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:33.490
Manaka-san...

00:00:33.490 --> 00:00:35.730
you'll be late for our dance lesson if you don't hurry.

00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:37.380
Capisce!

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:38.440
Ah-ee!

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:45.160
Head Disciplinarian Minami, Sophie! Jululu just said "Capisce"!

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:48.040
All I heard was "Ah-ee".

00:00:48.040 --> 00:00:49.160
Maybe.

00:00:50.010 --> 00:00:51.570
You think so?

00:00:54.510 --> 00:00:56.550
Hey, wait up!

00:00:56.690 --> 00:00:58.260
Lala and Mirei.

00:00:58.260 --> 00:01:01.250
The two of them have attained Super Cyalume Coords.

00:01:01.250 --> 00:01:02.360
Yep.

00:01:02.360 --> 00:01:05.820
We shan't concede the position of Divine Idol to them!

00:01:05.820 --> 00:01:08.500
What actions will converge our destinies?

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:12.650
Demon, demon, deruderubi!

00:01:16.440 --> 00:01:20.620
Aroma and Mikan and Garuru are spinning a baby around!

00:01:21.040 --> 00:01:23.810
It means we should bring Jululu to our side,

00:01:23.810 --> 00:01:28.020
in order to expose the true secret of the goddess Jewlie

00:01:28.020 --> 00:01:30.590
and advance to Divine Idols.

00:01:30.590 --> 00:01:32.550
Wow, way to go, Aroma!

00:01:32.860 --> 00:01:36.480
Verily! We shall call Garuru, and
Garumageddon shall depart forthwith!

00:01:36.480 --> 00:01:37.340
Yep!

00:01:37.340 --> 00:01:38.260
Garu!

00:01:40.140 --> 00:01:41.240
Capisce!

00:01:41.640 --> 00:01:43.440
I'm Manaka Lala!

00:01:43.440 --> 00:01:44.990
I'm in my sixth year of primary school!

00:01:44.990 --> 00:01:48.240
Collect Divine Coords and become a Divine Idol!

00:01:48.240 --> 00:01:51.770
One day, I discovered a mysterious baby in PriPara!

00:01:51.770 --> 00:01:54.250
She started calling me "Mama"...

00:01:54.250 --> 00:01:55.750
I can't believe this!

00:03:31.050 --> 00:03:33.740
Kuma, kuma, kuma, kuma!

00:03:33.740 --> 00:03:36.900
Feel the rhythm... kuma, kuma, kuma, kuma, kuma!

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:38.980
Come on, like you're walking on bear!

00:03:38.980 --> 00:03:41.680
And then watch as I become...

00:03:42.190 --> 00:03:44.140
Divine king over all managers!

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:46.090
Lala! I wanna see more hustle!

00:03:46.090 --> 00:03:47.320
Ca–Capisce!

00:03:47.640 --> 00:03:49.290
Mirei! I wanna hear more "pri-pri"!

00:03:49.290 --> 00:03:50.120
Pri!

00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:51.560
Sophie, let me hear that "pushu"!

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:54.860
Behold! It is Jululu!

00:03:57.280 --> 00:04:03.240
Today thou shalt witness the bewitching charms of the demonic familiar Salamander.

00:04:03.240 --> 00:04:07.970
Salako is a stuffed lizard Aroma's loved since she was a baby.

00:04:09.140 --> 00:04:11.000
She looks like Gajira.

00:04:11.290 --> 00:04:13.710
Salako is neither a lizard nor a monster.

00:04:14.180 --> 00:04:16.990
She is a salamander, a hell-born avatar of darkness.

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:23.060
Do you yearn for it?

00:04:23.660 --> 00:04:25.390
Then you should follow me.

00:04:25.890 --> 00:04:27.790
Let's all go together!

00:04:27.790 --> 00:04:28.500
Garu!

00:04:30.850 --> 00:04:33.570
Incur her wrath and you'll be damned!

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:37.250
I'll get it!

00:04:38.280 --> 00:04:39.330
Geru!

00:04:40.130 --> 00:04:41.520
I caughted it!

00:04:41.520 --> 00:04:43.000
Care to explain-pri?

00:04:43.900 --> 00:04:44.690
What's going on?

00:04:45.410 --> 00:04:49.240
<i>I wanted to steal away with her silently... time for a change of plans.</i>

00:04:49.940 --> 00:04:52.810
I have travelled to this realm to show Salako to Jululu.

00:04:56.920 --> 00:04:58.170
Oh, is that it?

00:04:59.020 --> 00:05:00.670
I think she loves Salako a lot.

00:05:00.670 --> 00:05:02.670
I guess love means bearing a lot of pain.

00:05:02.670 --> 00:05:06.130
It's a pri terrifying way of showing her love.

00:05:06.420 --> 00:05:08.190
All this belies is...

00:05:08.460 --> 00:05:10.840
A heart-rending sadness!

00:05:10.840 --> 00:05:12.060
Sadness?

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:14.480
She looks happy as a clam.

00:05:14.760 --> 00:05:16.180
A pox on thee!

00:05:16.180 --> 00:05:17.730
Fix your eyes properly!

00:05:18.690 --> 00:05:23.260
S-winging at her AD-versary N-umerous times in the ESS-ence of play.

00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:24.990
That is to say...

00:05:24.990 --> 00:05:27.010
It's "sadness"!

00:05:27.010 --> 00:05:27.890
Garu!

00:05:27.890 --> 00:05:28.690
What the heck?

00:05:28.690 --> 00:05:29.540
Wow, you're right!

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:38.460
According to my prophecy, returning Jululu to her former form shall not only restore her true self,

00:05:38.460 --> 00:05:40.500
but erase the sadness within her.

00:05:41.120 --> 00:05:42.140
Wow, really?

00:05:44.510 --> 00:05:47.760
Demon, demon, deruderubi!

00:05:49.870 --> 00:05:50.700
Kuma?

00:05:51.600 --> 00:05:52.880
Devi!

00:05:52.880 --> 00:05:55.310
All shall be resolved somehow with magic.

00:05:55.740 --> 00:05:58.770
Thus, the babe should be placed into mine embrace.

00:05:58.770 --> 00:06:00.010
What?

00:06:00.010 --> 00:06:02.410
Pri-ease, there's no way it told you that.

00:06:02.410 --> 00:06:05.760
Jululu looks really happy with the little lizard.

00:06:11.180 --> 00:06:12.370
You're right.

00:06:14.220 --> 00:06:15.090
Okay!

00:06:15.090 --> 00:06:18.000
I know you'll do a great job looking after Jululu, Aroma.

00:06:18.210 --> 00:06:19.390
Lala!

00:06:19.790 --> 00:06:22.910
I sure don't want Jululu to be sad.

00:06:23.610 --> 00:06:26.510
And wouldn't it be great if Jululu could make some new friends?

00:06:27.360 --> 00:06:28.890
I can comprihend <b><i>that</i></b>, at least.

00:06:29.410 --> 00:06:32.680
But you only get her for Lala's lesson.

00:06:32.900 --> 00:06:34.360
Garu!
Yeppers!

00:06:35.980 --> 00:06:37.760
It doth proceed well.

00:06:38.320 --> 00:06:39.800
See you in a bit, Jululu.

00:06:43.760 --> 00:06:48.410
Let us proceed to Garuru's sanctuary and complete Jewlie's summoning ritual.

00:06:48.410 --> 00:06:49.280
Garu!
Yep!

00:06:50.160 --> 00:06:51.660
I'm back-garu!

00:06:51.660 --> 00:06:52.450
I am come.

00:06:52.700 --> 00:06:54.160
Welcome back-nekon.

00:06:54.160 --> 00:06:55.620
Best of luck-itten.

00:06:55.620 --> 00:06:56.380
Garu!

00:06:56.380 --> 00:06:57.120
Devi!

00:06:57.120 --> 00:06:57.910
Geru!

00:07:06.200 --> 00:07:11.500
I'm amazed you were so enraptured by SubPara that you built an abode here.

00:07:13.790 --> 00:07:15.870
Wow, it's super cute!

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:18.430
Neko-nee helped me decorate it.

00:07:18.670 --> 00:07:21.320
Not bad, not bad at all!

00:07:26.900 --> 00:07:29.030
The preparations are complete.

00:07:30.040 --> 00:07:31.390
She hasn't changed.

00:07:32.180 --> 00:07:33.340
Verily.

00:07:33.340 --> 00:07:36.950
Say! Perhaps Jululu is the spawn of a demon!

00:07:37.180 --> 00:07:38.460
Wow!

00:07:39.120 --> 00:07:39.890
Geru?

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:42.960
Little Jululu's awake.

00:07:44.380 --> 00:07:45.690
Ma... Ma...

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:50.280
She wants to eat a marmalade bun!

00:07:50.580 --> 00:07:53.220
No, she seeks to maledict.

00:07:53.810 --> 00:07:56.720
Garuru thinks she's saying "Mama".

00:08:03.390 --> 00:08:06.110
A tortured cry from the infernal realms!

00:08:09.230 --> 00:08:11.610
A demon child does not cry!

00:08:11.610 --> 00:08:13.900
Cherubim do, but not like this!

00:08:13.900 --> 00:08:16.490
Garuru likes to roar "Garuru"!

00:08:21.640 --> 00:08:24.260
I think I just hear Jululu crying...

00:08:26.160 --> 00:08:29.150
I'm in a pinch! I'm in a pinch! I'm in da Vinci!

00:08:29.150 --> 00:08:32.220
I'm late for the con-serge Sudeikin!

00:08:33.580 --> 00:08:34.960
Guess I was hearing things.

00:08:34.960 --> 00:08:35.630
Pri much.

00:08:37.090 --> 00:08:39.650
Cease thy wailing, Jululu!

00:08:39.650 --> 00:08:42.390
Demon, demon, deruderubi!

00:08:42.700 --> 00:08:44.010
Geru...

00:08:44.010 --> 00:08:45.220
Hey, I know!

00:08:45.220 --> 00:08:47.560
Up high, up high!

00:08:50.530 --> 00:08:51.960
Well done, Mikan!

00:08:51.960 --> 00:08:52.840
Yep!

00:08:55.300 --> 00:08:57.320
Put her up high again, Mikan!

00:08:57.320 --> 00:08:58.430
Gotcha!

00:08:58.430 --> 00:09:00.450
Up high, up high!

00:09:00.820 --> 00:09:01.810
Geru!

00:09:01.810 --> 00:09:03.910
Way up high into Heaven!

00:09:04.240 --> 00:09:06.680
Splendid, Mikan! Keep it up!

00:09:06.880 --> 00:09:08.480
Yep, I gotcha!

00:09:08.480 --> 00:09:12.060
Up high into Heaven! Up high into Heaven!

00:09:12.060 --> 00:09:13.840
Up into... Heaven...

00:09:15.400 --> 00:09:17.260
Up high, up high!

00:09:17.260 --> 00:09:19.520
Up high... up high...

00:09:19.520 --> 00:09:21.260
Up... high...

00:09:23.890 --> 00:09:26.120
I am... finished.

00:09:26.730 --> 00:09:28.670
Garuru's gonna bite her!

00:09:28.670 --> 00:09:31.460
If you do that, she'll only cry <i>mo</i>–

00:09:38.610 --> 00:09:39.570
She's play-biting?

00:09:40.050 --> 00:09:41.370
Jululu's laughing!

00:09:41.550 --> 00:09:42.260
Garu!

00:09:42.260 --> 00:09:43.630
Do you like biting?

00:09:45.770 --> 00:09:47.720
Amazing. She likes it!

00:09:50.490 --> 00:09:53.210
We're gonna get along!

00:09:53.920 --> 00:09:56.460
Then stay there and keep being bitten.

00:09:56.460 --> 00:09:57.130
Yep...

00:09:57.710 --> 00:10:01.260
We'll consult the revelatory instruments for further hints.

00:10:05.660 --> 00:10:09.040
Desist! Withdraw your fangs at once, maligned infant!

00:10:09.500 --> 00:10:11.760
It hurts! Oh, the agony!

00:10:16.780 --> 00:10:19.490
You can't bite Aroma's cards!

00:10:22.590 --> 00:10:25.910
Please give me back my meat buns...

00:10:28.190 --> 00:10:31.550
Listen, Jululu. You must only bite Garuru.

00:10:31.550 --> 00:10:33.160
They don't like it-garu.

00:10:35.010 --> 00:10:36.300
Accursed fiend...

00:10:36.590 --> 00:10:40.740
At your age, we listened to our elders.

00:10:40.740 --> 00:10:44.370
And we could certainly sit still without screaming.

00:10:47.730 --> 00:10:49.140
She's sulking-garu.

00:10:52.730 --> 00:10:54.800
It's much easier to look after her like this.

00:10:55.210 --> 00:10:58.750
But how do we turn her back into Jewlie?

00:10:59.940 --> 00:11:02.000
I can't bite her like this!

00:11:02.000 --> 00:11:04.090
We can't get rid of her sadness either.

00:11:05.300 --> 00:11:08.190
Maligned malcontent and malaise.

00:11:08.940 --> 00:11:12.090
Demon, demon, deruderubi!

00:11:13.490 --> 00:11:14.770
It's "The World".

00:11:15.770 --> 00:11:18.380
She years to see other realms?

00:11:21.180 --> 00:11:24.330
It's got pizza and pandas and snow!

00:11:26.640 --> 00:11:27.970
Do you want to see snow?

00:11:30.200 --> 00:11:33.340
You want snow? Leave it to Garuru!

00:11:33.340 --> 00:11:35.020
Geru?
Devi?

00:11:45.550 --> 00:11:48.920
You want to use the Hologrammation device to make snow?

00:11:49.060 --> 00:11:50.250
Garu!

00:11:50.250 --> 00:11:53.980
But surely they've reinforced security procedures

00:11:53.980 --> 00:11:57.440
since when you last ran rampant with them.

00:11:59.580 --> 00:12:02.530
Garuru wants to make snow for Jululu!

00:12:02.530 --> 00:12:05.870
Garuru will be happy when Jululu comes back out!

00:12:05.870 --> 00:12:07.870
Yep, Mikan too!

00:12:08.290 --> 00:12:14.040
And I shan't complain if the devil Jululu is metamorphosed into the goddess Jewlie.

00:12:14.590 --> 00:12:18.130
Let us use the revelatory grimoire to force open that door!

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:20.300
I see, I see.

00:12:21.120 --> 00:12:22.930
Today's weather is fine and sunny.

00:12:23.740 --> 00:12:28.060
We should have clear skies the rest of the day! PriPara-dong-ding.

00:12:34.250 --> 00:12:35.180
Open!

00:12:35.230 --> 00:12:36.730
Sesame oil!

00:12:36.730 --> 00:12:38.070
Diabolical!

00:12:38.070 --> 00:12:41.150
She's spared no effort in reinforcing security.

00:12:42.990 --> 00:12:44.320
Did someone drop this?

00:12:45.650 --> 00:12:47.840
It won't... come off...

00:12:54.290 --> 00:12:56.750
She's got her special specs...

00:12:57.040 --> 00:12:58.560
We've infiltrated the inner sanctum.

00:12:58.560 --> 00:12:59.340
Garu!
Yep!

00:13:01.300 --> 00:13:03.740
Snowy weather's set-garu!

00:13:06.100 --> 00:13:07.730
Wow, it's snowing!

00:13:07.730 --> 00:13:08.970
Garu!

00:13:08.970 --> 00:13:10.510
Yep, yep, yep!

00:13:10.510 --> 00:13:12.890
Garuru did it! It's snowing now!

00:13:13.630 --> 00:13:15.280
Look, Jululu. It's snow-garu.

00:13:19.880 --> 00:13:20.930
Hey, it's snowing.

00:13:21.260 --> 00:13:22.750
It's so pretty!

00:13:23.500 --> 00:13:24.580
Huh?

00:13:24.580 --> 00:13:25.610
It's snowing?

00:13:33.020 --> 00:13:34.680
At the fringe of frivolity and frigidity.

00:13:34.680 --> 00:13:38.440
One of PriPara's best features is the variety of weather.

00:13:38.440 --> 00:13:40.250
Yeah, but it's <i>spring</i> right now, you know?

00:13:40.250 --> 00:13:42.550
What on Earth is Meganee doing?

00:13:42.550 --> 00:13:47.050
It's bunny... She did just say it'd be sunny the rest of the day, too.

00:13:47.410 --> 00:13:49.760
The snow's so pretty!

00:13:50.400 --> 00:13:52.580
It's like a snowy blanket?

00:13:52.580 --> 00:13:54.430
That sounds pri darn cold to me.

00:13:55.390 --> 00:13:59.660
But they just said it'd be sunny the rest of the day... beary strange.

00:14:00.420 --> 00:14:02.720
It's pretty-garu.

00:14:02.720 --> 00:14:06.200
Hey! I'm gonna show it to Gajira, too!

00:14:06.610 --> 00:14:12.250
Gajira!

00:14:16.650 --> 00:14:18.300
Are you having fun, Jululu?

00:14:19.770 --> 00:14:21.500
I'm glad-garu.

00:14:21.610 --> 00:14:26.220
Excellent! Then let us consult the prophecy on how to restore your previous form.

00:14:28.460 --> 00:14:30.110
Do you wanna see closer?

00:14:31.790 --> 00:14:34.430
And.. open! Yay!

00:14:41.920 --> 00:14:43.790
Sliding looks fun!

00:14:43.900 --> 00:14:46.290
I'm gonna do it too!

00:14:46.290 --> 00:14:47.780
It looks devilishly fun!

00:14:48.050 --> 00:14:50.280
Devi!

00:14:55.290 --> 00:14:56.660
How enjoyable!

00:14:56.660 --> 00:14:57.690
Yep!

00:14:59.290 --> 00:15:01.010
The devil descends upon us, eh?

00:15:02.660 --> 00:15:04.240
Is that Jululu down there-pri?

00:15:04.910 --> 00:15:07.240
The snow blanket looks so fluffy.

00:15:09.180 --> 00:15:10.980
Are we on a hidden camera show?

00:15:10.980 --> 00:15:12.890
There are so many Gajiras!

00:15:15.020 --> 00:15:16.850
Didja have fun, Jululu?

00:15:18.160 --> 00:15:20.440
Thou art as much a demon as I...

00:15:22.350 --> 00:15:24.530
Pea...! Pea...!

00:15:24.530 --> 00:15:25.700
"Pi...ggy"?

00:15:26.190 --> 00:15:28.010
Do you like pigs, too?

00:15:28.420 --> 00:15:31.760
Her desires aren't sated with the snow and Gajira?

00:15:32.380 --> 00:15:33.810
Truly a demon...

00:15:35.890 --> 00:15:38.490
Then, Garuru, to your black heart's content!

00:15:38.490 --> 00:15:42.500
Be it pig, cow or panda, rain it down upon us!

00:15:44.990 --> 00:15:48.280
Snow with a chance of Gajira! Then cows later in the afternoon!

00:15:48.350 --> 00:15:50.280
Hey, hold on–

00:16:01.900 --> 00:16:04.150
Hold on, my bovine brethren-da Vinci!

00:16:04.350 --> 00:16:06.250
This is a mess! Where's Jululu?

00:16:06.690 --> 00:16:09.760
I'm not your friend and I don't want you on my head!

00:16:14.060 --> 00:16:14.820
Open!

00:16:14.820 --> 00:16:15.950
Sesame oil!

00:16:18.410 --> 00:16:20.990
Garuru, you're causing trouble again?

00:16:20.990 --> 00:16:21.780
Garu.

00:16:22.970 --> 00:16:25.160
PriPara-ding-dong!

00:16:25.160 --> 00:16:27.930
Please allow me to apologise for the commotion!

00:16:27.930 --> 00:16:30.240
This has been a drill!

00:16:30.240 --> 00:16:31.590
Please disregard it.

00:16:32.180 --> 00:16:33.700
Jululu!

00:16:34.460 --> 00:16:36.060
Mama! Mama!

00:16:36.060 --> 00:16:36.890
Geru?

00:16:36.890 --> 00:16:37.080
Mama! Mama!

00:16:41.220 --> 00:16:43.210
How was it? Did you have fun?

00:16:43.210 --> 00:16:45.310
Mama! Mama!

00:16:46.290 --> 00:16:48.300
Garuru, very well done!

00:16:48.300 --> 00:16:50.010
Just <i>what</i> was "well done"?

00:16:50.010 --> 00:16:51.600
This has been pandemonium-pri!

00:16:52.430 --> 00:16:57.390
The babe's lamentations were unceasing... I had to employ demonic power.

00:16:58.260 --> 00:17:01.410
Jululu loves idols. Perform for her and she'll perk right up!

00:17:02.240 --> 00:17:03.470
Such a hand existed...

00:17:03.470 --> 00:17:04.780
Aw, jeez!

00:17:13.310 --> 00:17:16.180
Scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.

00:17:17.720 --> 00:17:20.110
You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.

00:17:20.510 --> 00:17:22.240
Starting the Coord Change.

00:17:24.810 --> 00:17:27.820
Today PriPara experienced some unseasonable snowfall.

00:17:27.820 --> 00:17:31.280
With this cosy and warm coord, though, it's no problem!

00:17:31.280 --> 00:17:33.310
North Fur Coord!

00:17:33.310 --> 00:17:34.320
Devi!

00:17:36.910 --> 00:17:39.220
A cute little polar bear design

00:17:39.220 --> 00:17:41.980
is printed on the toasty warm cape!

00:17:41.980 --> 00:17:44.180
Crystal Fur Coord!

00:17:44.180 --> 00:17:45.540
Geru!

00:17:51.800 --> 00:17:53.010
Darkness!

00:17:53.010 --> 00:17:55.650
