Our apostle, Garuru!

00:18:09.040 --> 00:18:10.160
Garu!

00:18:10.740 --> 00:18:12.850
Those who pass through the gates of PriPara!

00:18:12.850 --> 00:18:14.810
Cast aside all hope!

00:18:15.760 --> 00:18:19.450
No, I will take you to heaven-non!

