00:18:21.900 --> 00:18:23.250
Alomageddon and...

00:18:23.250 --> 00:18:24.280
Garuru!

00:18:24.280 --> 00:18:26.080
Devil, angel and beast together!

00:18:27.220 --> 00:18:29.320
