00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:30.800
Garu!

00:18:33.570 --> 00:18:35.280
Hark, demon Jululu!

00:18:35.280 --> 00:18:38.160
Listen well to this accursed melody and be enraptured,

00:18:38.160 --> 00:18:39.790
